    "Adresa serveru": "Server address",
    "Server se použije, když čas bere server. Ruční čas ho nepotřebuje.": "The server is used when the time comes from a server. Time set by hand does not need it.",
    "Uložením se server vypne a platí tento čas. Po restartu zůstane.": "Saving turns the server off and this time applies. It stays after a restart.",
